{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22237","headline":"秋日怀杓直 · 白居易","name":"秋日怀杓直","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晚来天色好，独出江边步。\n忆与李舍人，曲江相近住。\n常云遇清景，必约同幽趣。\n若不访我来，还须觅君去。\n开眉笑相见，把手期何处。\n西寺老胡僧，南园乱松树。\n携持小酒榼，吟咏新诗句。\n同出复同归，从朝直至暮。\n风雨忽消散，江山眇回互。\n浔阳与涔阳，相望空云雾。\n心期自乖旷，时景还如故。\n今日郡斋中，秋光谁共度。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22237.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22237","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}